(-: A book of {teacher}'s words (-:

    ( What to write (
        A book of {teacher}'s words on {topic}. A title and subtitle, a
        contents list, a preface of your own under 400 words, then six to
        twelve chapters. Each chapter has a title, an opening paragraph of
        your own, the quotations that belong to it in a deliberate order with
        their source lines, and a closing line. Then a short afterword and
        the Sources. The length follows the material, with no padding.
    ) End what to write ) Many blessings

    [= The reply [=
        Markdown, the book's title as a # heading, each chapter a ## heading,
        each quotation a blockquote with its source line after it.
    =] End the reply =] Warm thanks

:-) End a book of {teacher}'s words :-) So much gratitude
